WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:06.325
[ cawing]

00:00:09.632 --> 00:00:11.678
FUDGE:
It is the decision

00:00:11.721 --> 00:00:13.375
of the Committee
for the disposal

00:00:13.419 --> 00:00:15.377
of Dangerous Creatures
that the hippogriff

00:00:15.421 --> 00:00:19.860
known as Buckbeak, hereinafter
called the condemned,

00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:22.253
shall be executed this day

00:00:22.297 --> 00:00:23.211
at sundown.

00:00:23.254 --> 00:00:24.517
HAGRID:
Oh, dear, dear...

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.388
DUMBLEDORE:
Now, now, Hagrid.

00:00:26.432 --> 00:00:28.347
All right, it'll be all right.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:30.044
[ stick snapping]

00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:32.481
HARRY:
What?

00:00:32.525 --> 00:00:34.875
I thought I just saw...

00:00:34.918 --> 00:00:36.398
Never mind.

00:00:36.442 --> 00:00:38.269
Let's go.

00:00:40.750 --> 00:00:43.710
[ panting]

00:00:43.753 --> 00:00:47.366
[ low growl]

00:00:53.937 --> 00:01:00.030
[ panting]

00:01:04.644 --> 00:01:09.736
♪

00:01:16.786 --> 00:01:20.703
♪

00:01:26.492 --> 00:01:30.931
[ slicing][ cawing]

00:01:30.974 --> 00:01:32.802
Oh, no.

00:01:32.846 --> 00:01:36.458
[ crying]

00:01:41.550 --> 00:01:42.421
Ow!

00:01:42.464 --> 00:01:44.118
[ squealing]

00:01:44.161 --> 00:01:45.380
He bit me.

00:01:45.424 --> 00:01:46.555
Scabbers!

00:01:46.599 --> 00:01:47.600
Ron?

00:01:47.643 --> 00:01:48.992
Ron?!

00:01:49.036 --> 00:01:50.907
HARRY:
Ron?!

00:01:50.951 --> 00:01:53.388
Scabbers!
Come back!

00:01:53.432 --> 00:01:54.607
[ panting]

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.087
HARRY:
Wait!

00:01:57.131 --> 00:02:00.961
[ panting]

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:03.746
Scabbers, you bit me.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:05.269
Harry, you
do realize

00:02:05.313 --> 00:02:06.488
what tree this is.

00:02:06.532 --> 00:02:08.098
That's not good.

00:02:08.142 --> 00:02:09.143
Ron, run!

00:02:09.186 --> 00:02:11.450
[ squeaking]

00:02:11.493 --> 00:02:13.408
Harry, Hermione, run!

00:02:13.452 --> 00:02:16.542
[ growling]It's the Grim!

00:02:17.151 --> 00:02:18.674
[ growling]

00:02:18.718 --> 00:02:20.981
[ barking]

00:02:22.678 --> 00:02:23.940
[ yelling]

00:02:23.984 --> 00:02:25.202
Harry!

00:02:25.246 --> 00:02:26.943
Ron! Ron, wait!Ron!

00:02:26.987 --> 00:02:28.336
[ crying]:
Harry!

00:02:28.379 --> 00:02:30.294
[ growling]Ron!

00:02:30.338 --> 00:02:32.122
Harry, help!

00:02:32.471 --> 00:02:33.341
Ron!

00:02:33.384 --> 00:02:35.169
[ screams]

00:02:35.212 --> 00:02:36.344
Ron!

00:02:36.387 --> 00:02:38.172
Ron!Ron!

00:02:38.215 --> 00:02:40.087
[ creaking]

00:02:40.130 --> 00:02:41.131
[ grunting]

00:02:41.175 --> 00:02:44.700
[ groaning]

00:02:46.572 --> 00:02:51.141
[ creaking]

00:02:51.185 --> 00:02:53.361
[ Ron screaming]

00:02:53.404 --> 00:02:54.971
HARRY:
Come on.

00:02:57.539 --> 00:02:58.322
Move!

00:02:58.366 --> 00:03:01.195
[ grunting]

00:03:01.238 --> 00:03:02.762
[ panting]Duck!

00:03:02.805 --> 00:03:03.589
[ creaking]

00:03:03.632 --> 00:03:05.895
[ grunting]

00:03:09.377 --> 00:03:11.640
[ gasps]

00:03:11.901 --> 00:03:14.121
[ grunts]

00:03:14.164 --> 00:03:16.297
[ creaking]

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:18.255
[ grunting]

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.738
[ Hermione screaming]

00:03:22.782 --> 00:03:25.741
[ screaming]

00:03:27.438 --> 00:03:29.353
Harry!

00:03:29.397 --> 00:03:31.442
[ screaming]

00:03:32.356 --> 00:03:35.534
[ gasping]

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:42.149
Harry!

00:03:44.238 --> 00:03:46.283
Huh?

00:03:50.244 --> 00:03:51.593
[ grunting]

00:03:51.637 --> 00:03:52.420
[ yelling]

00:03:52.463 --> 00:03:55.597
[ grunting]

00:03:55.641 --> 00:03:57.599
[ screams]

00:03:57.643 --> 00:03:59.819
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:59.862 --> 00:04:01.037
Don't worry.

00:04:01.081 --> 00:04:03.474
Where do you
suppose this goes?

00:04:03.518 --> 00:04:05.694
I have a hunch.

00:04:05.738 --> 00:04:08.392
I just hope I'm wrong.

00:04:16.966 --> 00:04:20.143
[ creaking]

00:04:26.976 --> 00:04:31.807
We're in the Shrieking
Shack, aren't we?

00:04:31.851 --> 00:04:33.374
Come on.

00:04:37.683 --> 00:04:41.208
[ grunts and groans]

00:04:42.122 --> 00:04:43.732
[ yelling]

00:04:43.776 --> 00:04:45.299
Ron!

00:04:45.342 --> 00:04:46.779
Ron, you're okay!

00:04:46.822 --> 00:04:48.302
The dog--
where is it?!

00:04:48.345 --> 00:04:49.564
Harry, it's a trap!

00:04:49.608 --> 00:04:51.131
He's the dog!
He's an Animagus!

00:04:58.747 --> 00:05:01.750
[ door creaking]

00:05:04.187 --> 00:05:05.449
If you want
to kill Harry,

00:05:05.493 --> 00:05:07.408
you'll have to
kill us, too!

00:05:07.451 --> 00:05:08.365
No.

00:05:08.409 --> 00:05:10.411
Only one will die tonight.

00:05:10.454 --> 00:05:12.631
Then it'll be you!

00:05:12.674 --> 00:05:14.284
[ grunting]

00:05:14.328 --> 00:05:16.504
[ panting]

00:05:17.026 --> 00:05:18.027
[ chuckling]

00:05:18.071 --> 00:05:20.943
Are you going to kill me, Harry?

00:05:20.987 --> 00:05:21.770
[ chuckles]

00:05:21.814 --> 00:05:22.815
Expelliarmus!

00:05:22.858 --> 00:05:23.903
[ gasping]

00:05:23.946 --> 00:05:26.340
[ creaking]

00:05:26.383 --> 00:05:29.082
Well, well, Sirius...

00:05:29.125 --> 00:05:31.258
looking rather
ragged, aren't we?

00:05:31.301 --> 00:05:34.522
Finally the flesh reflects
the madness within.

00:05:34.565 --> 00:05:37.481
Well, you'd know all
about the madness within,

00:05:37.525 --> 00:05:39.919
wouldn't you, Remus?

00:05:49.624 --> 00:05:50.538
I found him!I know.

00:05:50.581 --> 00:05:51.887
He's here!I understand.

00:05:51.931 --> 00:05:53.149
Let's kill him.

00:05:53.193 --> 00:05:54.542
No!

00:05:54.585 --> 00:05:55.848
I trusted you!

00:05:55.891 --> 00:06:00.504
And all this time
y-you've been his friend.

00:06:00.548 --> 00:06:01.854
He's a werewolf!

00:06:01.897 --> 00:06:04.204
That's why he's
been missing classes.

00:06:05.596 --> 00:06:07.642
How long have
you known?

00:06:07.686 --> 00:06:09.862
Since Professor Snape
set the essay.

00:06:09.905 --> 00:06:11.428
Well, well,
well, Hermione.

00:06:11.472 --> 00:06:13.039
You really are
the brightest witch

00:06:13.082 --> 00:06:14.518
of your age
I've ever met.

00:06:14.562 --> 00:06:15.737
Enough talk, Remus!

00:06:15.781 --> 00:06:17.739
Come on, let's
kill him!

00:06:17.783 --> 00:06:18.522
Wait!

00:06:18.566 --> 00:06:20.220
I did my waiting!

00:06:20.263 --> 00:06:23.310
12 years of it...

00:06:23.353 --> 00:06:25.878
in Azkaban!

00:06:25.921 --> 00:06:29.098
[ creaking]

00:06:30.186 --> 00:06:32.536
[ panting]

00:06:34.495 --> 00:06:36.105
Very well.

00:06:36.149 --> 00:06:37.150
Kill him.

00:06:37.193 --> 00:06:39.587
But wait one more minute.

00:06:39.630 --> 00:06:41.284
Harry has the right to know why.

00:06:41.328 --> 00:06:43.286
HARRY:
I know why!

00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:44.940
You betrayed my parents!

00:06:44.984 --> 00:06:47.769
You're the reason
they're dead!

00:06:47.813 --> 00:06:48.988
No, Harry, it wasn't him.

00:06:49.031 --> 00:06:50.554
Somebody did
betray your parents,

00:06:50.598 --> 00:06:53.340
but it was somebody
who, until quite recently,

00:06:53.383 --> 00:06:54.645
I believed to be dead!

00:06:54.689 --> 00:06:56.778
Who was it, then?

00:06:56.822 --> 00:06:57.866
Peter Pettigrew!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:06:59.607
And he's in this room!

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:01.783
Right now!

00:07:01.827 --> 00:07:04.525
Come out, come out, Peter!

00:07:04.568 --> 00:07:07.049
Come out, come
out and play!

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:08.137
Expelliarmus!

00:07:08.181 --> 00:07:09.182
[ gasping]

00:07:09.225 --> 00:07:10.879
[ squealing]Ah!

00:07:10.923 --> 00:07:12.838
Vengeance is sweet.

00:07:12.881 --> 00:07:16.145
How I hoped
I'd be the one to catch you.

00:07:16.189 --> 00:07:17.190
Severus, it...

00:07:17.233 --> 00:07:18.757
I told Dumbledore

00:07:18.800 --> 00:07:21.281
you were helping an old friend
into the castle, and now

00:07:21.324 --> 00:07:22.499
here's the proof.

00:07:22.543 --> 00:07:24.110
Brilliant, Snape.

00:07:24.153 --> 00:07:25.851
Once again, you put your keen
and penetrating mind

00:07:25.894 --> 00:07:28.070
to the task, and as usual,
come to the wrong conclusion.

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:29.985
Now, if you'll excuse
us, Remus and I have

00:07:30.029 --> 00:07:32.161
some unfinished
business to attend to.

00:07:32.205 --> 00:07:33.467
[ gasps]

00:07:33.510 --> 00:07:35.164
Give me a reason.

00:07:35.208 --> 00:07:36.252
I beg you!

00:07:36.296 --> 00:07:37.253
Severus, don't
be a fool.

00:07:37.297 --> 00:07:38.254
He can't help it.

00:07:38.298 --> 00:07:39.255
It's habit by now.

00:07:39.299 --> 00:07:40.213
Sirius, be quiet!

00:07:40.256 --> 00:07:41.301
Oh, quiet yourself, Remus!

00:07:41.344 --> 00:07:42.519
Oh, listen to you two,

00:07:42.563 --> 00:07:43.912
quarreling like an old
married couple.

00:07:43.956 --> 00:07:45.044
Why don't you run along

00:07:45.087 --> 00:07:46.480
and play with
your chemistry set?

00:07:46.523 --> 00:07:49.483
I could do it, you know.

00:07:49.526 --> 00:07:51.746
But why deny the dementors?

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:54.836
They're so longing to see you.

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.534
Do I detect
a flicker of fear?

00:07:57.578 --> 00:07:58.666
Oh, yes.

00:07:58.709 --> 00:08:00.189
A dementor's kiss.

00:08:00.233 --> 00:08:01.669
One can only imagine what
that must be like to endure.

00:08:01.712 --> 00:08:05.020
It's said to be nearly
unbearable to witness,

00:08:05.064 --> 00:08:07.544
but I'll do my best.

00:08:07.588 --> 00:08:09.242
LUPIN:
Severus, please!

00:08:10.896 --> 00:08:13.376
After you.

